raps, and glossy white chunky block-heel Mary Jane platform shoes with silver buckles. Delicate cursive tonal garment embroidery reading \"alicehan_ai\" is subtly placed beside the cuff seam in a small monogram area.\n\nThe seamless backdrop consists of softly draped white fabric cascading gently onto a smooth matching white studio floor. Bright, even, diffused high-key studio softbox lighting provides wrap-around illumination, revealing gentle specular roll-off along the burgundy silk satin, distinct tactile lace weave, and soft-edged contact shadows on the floor without harsh clipping or flat airbrushing."
